---

# EXPECTED FALSE POSITIVE PREVENTION

These MUST NOT be flagged:

```json
{
  "title": "phone",
  "titleDescription": "The contact phone number for the Client.",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "countryCode",
      "example": "1"
    }
  ]
}
```

Reason:

* `title != phone_number`
* child title != number
* description/titleDescription must NOT establish PII context anymore.

---

# EXPECTED VALID STRUCTURED MATCH

```json
{
  "title": "phone_number",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "number",
      "example": "9999999999"
    }
  ]
}
```

Reason:

* title establishes phone_number context
* child title == number
* example validated.

---

# EXPECTED VALID OTHER-PII MATCH

```json
{
  "title": "email",
  "example": "real@gmail.com"
}
```

Reason:

* title establishes email context
* example validated.

---

# EXPECTED NON-TRIGGER

```json
{
  "description": "customer email",
  "example": "real@gmail.com"
}
```

Reason:

* description must NOT establish pii context anymore.
